---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Imgify"
  description="How Imgify handles your data. Image tools run in your browser — your files are not uploaded to our servers."
  canonical="/privacy"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
>
  <section>
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Summary</h2>
    <p>
      Imgify provides free image tools that run in your web browser. We do not ask you to create an
      account, and we do not upload your images to our servers for processing.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Your images</h2>
    <p>
      When you use our converters or resizer, your files are processed locally on your device using
      your browser. We do not receive, store, or have access to the images you select.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Information we may collect</h2>
    <p class="mb-3">We do not collect personal information through our tools. Like most websites, basic technical data may be logged when you visit, such as:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
      <li>IP address</li>
      <li>Browser type and device information</li>
      <li>Pages visited and referring URL</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-3">
      This data is used to operate and secure the site. Our hosting provider (Cloudflare) may process
      this information on our behalf.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Third-party services</h2>
    <p class="mb-3">We use the following third-party services that may collect data under their own policies:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
      <li>
        <strong class="font-medium text-gray-900">Google Fonts</strong> — fonts are loaded from
        Google servers when you visit the site.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong class="font-medium text-gray-900">Advertising partners</strong> — we may display ads
        from third-party networks. Those partners may use cookies or similar technologies to serve
        and measure ads.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We do not set cookies for account or tool functionality. Third-party advertisers may set
      cookies when ads are shown. You can control cookies through your browser settings.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Children</h2>
    <p>Imgify is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy from time to time. Continued use of the site after changes means you
      accept the updated policy.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy? Email
      <a href="mailto:hello@imgify.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">hello@imgify.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
